## Frequently asked questions

**How much does a startup website cost?**

From £20 a month inc. VAT for a managed starter website with no upfront cost, or from £199 for a one-page WordPress website you own. Larger sites are quoted around your brief. [Get a free plan](/free-website-plan/) and we'll recommend the right option.

**Can my website grow with the business?**

Yes. We can add service pages, location pages, a blog or an online shop as you grow, without rebuilding from scratch.

**I haven't launched yet. Can I still have a website?**

Yes. A pre-launch page can explain your idea and collect interest before you open, like the site we built for [Priva-Cy](/portfolio/priva-cy/).

**Can I update it myself?**

Yes. You get full access to manage your own content, and we show you how.

**Do you help with Google rankings?**

Yes. Every site includes on-page SEO foundations, and we offer [local SEO packages](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/) once you're ready to grow.
